&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;‘오늘도 죽을똥말똥 까대기, 바닥에 시스템 박스(System Box) 깔고 있네.’ 격하게 공감하시나요?&lt;/p&gt;

                            &lt;div style=&#39;width:100%; max-width:550px; margin:25px auto; overflow:hidden; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); background:#000;&#39;&gt;
                                &lt;video src=&#39;https://play.scsi.kr/?url=https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/33745640/14326872_640_360_60fps.mp4&#39; controls autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=&#39;metadata&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; display:block; max-height:500px; background:#000;&#39;&gt;&lt;/video&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;끝없이 이어지는 단순 반복 작업, 육체적, 정신적으로 우리를 지치게 만드는 주범이죠. 이런 비효율은 더 이상 그만!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.zeroworker.scsi.kr/1782527479194_330mk.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;하지만 바로 이 순간이 의미 있는 전환점입니다. 무작정 달려들기보다 잠깐 멈춰서.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.zeroworker.scsi.kr/1782527480918_hnz5o.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;매뉴얼(Manual)한 작업에 시간을 쏟기 전에, 자동화(Automation)나 효율화(Efficiency)의 가능성을 먼저 탐색해보세요.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.zeroworker.scsi.kr/1782527482231_yaz9k.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&#39;line-height:1.7; margin-bottom:14px; color:#334155; font-size:15px;&#39;&gt;지금의 ‘까대기’가 언젠가 당신의 업무를 자유롭게 할 자동화(Automation)의 단단한 기반이 될 수 있도록.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&#39;text-align:center; margin:20px 0;&#39;&gt;&lt;img src=&#39;https://cdn.zeroworker.scsi.kr/1782527483555_6pk1n.webp&#39; style=&#39;width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:8px;&#39; alt=&#39;본문 이미지&#39; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description><link>https://zeroworkernim.scsi.kr/2026/06/blog-post_577.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (라이프가이드)</author><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8013315112205910937.post-7343691351475368554</guid><pubDate>Thu, 25 Jun 2026 10:34:40 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2026-06-25T03:34:40.957-07:00</atom:updated><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">zeroworker</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">나만의</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">높이는</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">돕고</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">아멘</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">업무</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">자동화</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">퇴근길에기록하는나의</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">피로를</category><category domain="http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#">효율을</category><title>퇴근길에 기록하는 나의 길.</title><description>&lt;style&gt;
